<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - April 11.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - April 11.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Centro Prop	    16.16     2.15</p>
<p> 2   Mt Leyshon Gold	12.50     2.00</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	10.00     0.98</p>
<p> 4   Aust Tour		 9.62     0.78</p>
<p> 5   Prop Income Inv	 9.52     1.06</p>
<p> 6   BT Prop Trust	   9.33     1.75</p>
<p> 7   Indu Property	   9.15     0.94</p>
